<a href=\"/wiki/Candy\" title=\"Candy\">Candy</a>/stud, $??/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">30 <a href=\"/wiki/Candy\" title=\"Candy\">Candy</a>/stud, $16/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">37.5 <a href=\"/wiki/Candy\" title=\"Candy\">Candy</a>/stud, $20/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.40.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">October 7th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Bone Tree</b> was a limited tree released in the Halloween 2023 update, only spawning when a Halloween Meteor crashes. After the 1.60.0 update, the tree was readded permanently.\n</p><p>The Bone Tree surrounded a central <a href=\"/wiki/Hallow_Tree\" title=\"Hallow Tree\">Hallow Tree</a> in groups of 4 or 5 when it spawned. It now spawns in the caves of the Oke Desert on <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This tree, along with the <a href=\"/wiki/Hallow_Tree\" title=\"Hallow Tree\">Hallow Tree</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Tree\" title=\"Tree\">Tree</a>, was one of the only trees to have square shaped logs before it was changed.</li>\n<li>This was the only tree that had leaves with player collisions.</li>\n<li>Despite its similarities with the Hallow Tree, the Bone Tree is much easier to fell, requiring roughly 3-5 hits with the <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Axe\" title=\"Refined Axe\">Refined Axe</a> and 2 hits with the <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane</a>.</li>\n<li><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/10/2560743343_9938675423_1728245283812.png/revision/latest?cb=20241006200936\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"This is the corrupted bone tree.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"95\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"2560743343 9938675423 1728245283812.png\" data-image-key=\"2560743343_9938675423_1728245283812.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/10/2560743343_9938675423_1728245283812.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241006200936\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/10/2560743343_9938675423_1728245283812.png/revision/latest?cb=20241006200936\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"This is the corrupted bone tree.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/10/2560743343_9938675423_1728245283812.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241006200936\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"95\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"2560743343 9938675423 1728245283812.png\" data-image-key=\"2560743343_9938675423_1728245283812.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/10/2560743343_9938675423_1728245283812.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20241006200936\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:2560743343_9938675423_1728245283812.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">This is the corrupted bone tree.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>When hit by a spore from the Mysterious Mushroom, it turns \"Corrupted\".</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Bone Tree (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6Qm9uZV9UcmVlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></span> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Bone_Tree\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Bone_Tree?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-fil